    'UI_PLATFORM_CARD_BRIDEG_ADD_TIPS' => "Adding this configuration will trigger a network restart, causing a brief disconnection. Only one bridged network can be created per NIC, and the original IP of the NIC will be taken over by the bridged network.",
    'UI_PLATFORM_CARD_BRIDEG_DELETE_TIPS' => "Executing the cleanup action may impact the system network. Please handle with caution!",
    'UI_PLATGORM_CARD_BRIDEG_LIST_TIPS1' => "The isolate_bridge is automatically created by the backup system, obtaining an isolated network IP and connecting to the isolate_network. It is typically used for communication with verification machines within the same isolated network.",
    'UI_PLATGORM_CARD_BRIDEG_LIST_TIPS2' => "The prod_bridge is automatically created by the backup system, taking over the IP of the first physical network interface card and connecting to the prod_network. It is typically used for communication with failover machines within the same production network and provides the ability to communicate with external networks.",
