    'UI_CUSTOM_REPOSRT_INFO_HEADER' => "The report template feature provides users with an easy-to-use solution for report generation and configuration. With simple operations, users can quickly create customized report templates to achieve efficient data statistics and visual presentation. The following is a detailed overview of this feature:",
    'UI_CUSTOM_REPOSRT_INFO_BODY_TIPS1' => "Report template viewing: View basic configuration information of each template in the list, such as template name, creation time, and last modified time. By clicking on a specific template name, users can further view the detailed report content of that template and obtain richer presentation styles and statistical results.",
    'UI_CUSTOM_REPOSRT_INFO_BODY_TIPS2' => "Create new report template: In the creation page, users can dynamically select the desired template type, configure overview data items, operation trends, and customize statistical fields. This determines the basic structure, data content, and final presentation method of the report.",
